  "prefLabel": "Site 102.39 Public information session",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.39 “Public information session” means a public meeting held before or after the filing of an application at which the applicant presents information to the public regarding the proposed facility, as provided for in RSA 162-H:10, I and I-a.\n\nSource. #10993, eff 12-16-15",
